        "original_id": "8f902af2-c137-52ac-b61b-62db0c175e1a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mack Brown\n- Organizations: Texas Longhorns football, Iowa State Cyclones football, Kansas State Wildcats football, ESPN\n- Places: Darrell K Royal–Texas Memorial Stadium, Manhattan, Kansas\n- Events: 2011 Texas Longhorns football season, 2011 Iowa State Cyclones football season, Farmageddon series\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2011 Texas Longhorns football season, the Texas Longhorns were led by 14th-year head coach Mack Brown.\n- During the 2011 Texas Longhorns football season, the Texas Longhorns played their home games at Darrell K Royal–Texas Memorial Stadium.\n- During the 2011 Iowa State Cyclones football season, Iowa State began conference play with a home loss to the Texas Longhorns.\n- During the 2011 Iowa State Cyclones football season, Iowa State ended conference play with a loss to the Kansas State Wildcats in Manhattan, Kansas in the Farmageddon series.\n- During the 2011 Iowa State Cyclones football season, Iowa State had a 3–6 conference record.\n- Mack Brown is currently a college football commentator for ESPN.",
